      "name": "dormanie",
      "created_at": "2025-09-14T07:35:30.846Z",
      "cooked": "<p>m facing a puzzling issue with payroll calculation in my ERPNext system. The deductions are being added to the Gross Pay instead of being subtracted, resulting in an incorrect Net Pay.</p>\n<p>Here’s the data from the payslip:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gross Pay:</strong>  500,000,000</li>\n<li><strong>Total Deductions:</strong>  37,000,000 (from two components: <code>ter-22</code> and <code>ter-33</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>Expected Net Pay (Manual Calculation):</strong> 500,000,000 - 37,000,000 = <strong>463,000,000</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Actual Net Pay (from the System):</strong> ** 537,000,000**</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The system’s calculation seems to be <code>Gross Pay + Total Deductions</code>.</p>\n<p>Has anyone encountered this problem before? Could this be a configuration error in the <strong>Salary Component</strong> setup (e.g., a component incorrectly set as an “Earning” instead of “Deduction” or a formula issue)? Any advice on how to debug this would be a great help.</p>\n<p>Thank you!<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/4/e469049e7b757865fcad62eb08b372ee1e0c2ce0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e469049e7b757865fcad62eb08b372ee1e0c2ce0\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e469049e7b757865fcad62eb08b372ee1e0c2ce0_2_690x361.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wABRwQbJoGGRggUg8lscvgS8Cmk\" width=\"690\" height=\"361\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e469049e7b757865fcad62eb08b372ee1e0c2ce0_2_690x361.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e469049e7b757865fcad62eb08b372ee1e0c2ce0_2_1035x541.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/4/e469049e7b757865fcad62eb08b372ee1e0c2ce0.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1038×544 23.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f11a64f0c8669411e1b4ed3d25ee310b394e2ce.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1f11a64f0c8669411e1b4ed3d25ee310b394e2ce\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f11a64f0c8669411e1b4ed3d25ee310b394e2ce_2_690x326.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4qQCb1v8ibRGxPgfplsDcP0XaGO\" width=\"690\" height=\"326\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f11a64f0c8669411e1b4ed3d25ee310b394e2ce_2_690x326.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f11a64f0c8669411e1b4ed3d25ee310b394e2ce.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f11a64f0c8669411e1b4ed3d25ee310b394e2ce.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">955×452 29.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
